// EASCape: ours. The quest itself lives in the 377 cache's own elid_main varp (616, now perm) and
// its varbits; these two remember what the cache has no bit for.

// 1 once the genie has traded you the statuette for a sole (his "I have lost my statuette" talk
// is only for those who traded and lost it)
[elid_traded]
scope=perm
protect=no

// 1 once Zahur has told you what she does (the OSRS wiki: "Hi there..." the first time, "Hello
// again" after; Void's spoke_nardah_herblist)
[elid_zahur_met]
scope=perm
protect=no
